<Base
  title="Quagmire cipher I-IV — encrypt and decrypt online"
  description="Encrypt and decrypt all four Quagmire ciphers online with keyword-mixed alphabets, period key, and indicator letter. Runs in your browser."
>
  <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Quagmire ciphers</h1>
  <p class="mb-8 max-w-prose text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
    The four Quagmire ciphers are Vigenère variants that use keyword-mixed
    alphabets. Quagmire I keys the plaintext alphabet, II keys the ciphertext
    alphabet, III keys both with the same keyword, and IV uses two different
    keywords. The indicator letter fixes how the key letters align with the
    plaintext alphabet. Kryptos K1 and K2 are Quagmire III with the keyword
    KRYPTOS.
  </p>
  <QuagmireTool />
</Base>
